  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">Here's a description for your UpPromote marketplace listing:</p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\"><strong>About our brand and products:</strong></p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">CaniNectar is a science backed canine gut health supplement made by Tharos Ltd, a UK animal health company. It is an Enzyme-Rich Malt Extract (ERME) that works through an \"anabiomic\" mechanism, supporting your dog's digestive health from the inside out. Our professional trial across 81 dogs and 47 animal health professionals produced strong, statistically significant results, including a notable improvement in anxiety related behaviours in high-anxiety dogs and a rise in handler confidence over just four weeks. CaniNectar is trusted by trainers, behaviourists, groomers and vets across the UK.</p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\"><strong>What makes us different:</strong></p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">Most gut supplements rely on adding probiotics or fibre. CaniNectar works differently. It modifies the substrates in your dog's gut enzymatically first, which then naturally supports a healthier microbiome as a downstream effect. This mechanism is backed by real trial data and published scientific literature, not marketing claims. We pride ourselves on honest, evidence-led positioning, so you can promote us with genuine confidence.</p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\"><strong>How affiliates can earn:</strong></p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">Our reviewer program offers a generous, transparent commission structure:</p><ul class=\"[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3\"><li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">40% commission on the first order from any new customer you refer</li><li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">10% commission on every repeat order that customer makes within 365 days of their first order</li><li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">10% commission on orders from existing customers</li></ul><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">This means you earn strongly on the first sale and continue earning as your referred customers reorder throughout the year.</p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\"><strong>How to promote us:</strong></p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">Share your honest experience of CaniNectar with your audience through blog posts, reviews, social media content, videos, newsletters and product recommendations. You can link directly using your unique affiliate link, feature CaniNectar in gut health or dog wellbeing content, or include it in roundups and comparison pieces. Authentic, first-hand reviews tend to perform best with our product.</p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\"><strong>Other information:</strong></p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">CaniNectar is proudly UK made and formulated for dogs of all sizes. We provide product information, trial data summaries and supporting materials to help you create accurate, compelling content. Our team is responsive and happy to answer questions or provide samples for genuine reviewers. We value long-term partnerships built on trust and transparency.</p></div></div>",
